alue. Discarding F3 allows me to focus on developing my suited tiles into either a Full Flush in Bamboo or a strong mixed hand with multiple chows. This keeps maximum flexibility for drawing useful tiles while eliminating dead weight.\n\nAnswer: Play F3"}
